{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02980","headline":"晨坐斋中偶而成咏 · 张九龄","name":"晨坐斋中偶而成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒露洁秋空，遥山纷在瞩。\n孤顶乍修耸，微云复相续。\n人兹赏地偏，鸟亦爱林旭。\n结念凭幽远，抚躬曷羁束。\n仰霄谢逸翰，临路嗟疲足。\n徂岁方暌携，归心亟踯躅。\n休闲倘有素，岂负南山曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}